  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "口語表達",
    "sub_ename": "ORAL EXPRESSION",
    "describe_ch": "口語表達是中文系實務課程，為強化學生口語溝通與表達之能力而設計。課程內容包括：一、發聲技巧；二、口語表達的魅力、分寸與技巧；三、口語表達情境演練；四、故事表達與敘事；五、魅力演說的技巧；六、TED 影片結構分析與演練；七、簡報與自我行銷。",
    "describe_eh": "Oral expression is a practical course of the Chinese Department, designed to strengthen students' ability of oral communication and expression. The course content includes: 1. Voice skills; 2. Oral expression charm, proportion and skills; 3. Oral expression situational exercises; 4. Story expression and narration; 5. Charm speaking skills; 6. TED film structure analysis and exercises; 7. Briefing and self-marketing.",
